So it's a really important concept here that we are might have some nuances and some variance between

01:43.980 --> 01:51.360
how you manage a project and how you do it in health care but the generally accepted practices are universal

01:51.750 --> 01:58.500
that in I.T. or a government project or healthcare or construction we always do initiation.

01:58.500 --> 02:01.090
We always plan we execute.

02:01.140 --> 02:03.970
